// Expected: f0 at one session and at two.
//
// The counterweight to forward_transitive_relay.vp. Guard the first leg too
// and no leg carrying the value is open, so nothing the attacker can do
// decides what Dave hashes and the value he uses is Alice's fresh one.
// Carrying a sender's execution forward must not become a way to reach a
// value no unguarded delivery ever exposed.

attacker[active]

principal Alice[
	generates fra_x
]

principal Bob[]
principal Carol[]

Alice -> Bob: [fra_x]
Bob -> Carol: [fra_x]
Carol -> Dave: [fra_x]

principal Dave[
	fra_y = HASH(fra_x)
]

queries[
	freshness? fra_x
]
